    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97dd006f9586fb5fad3e65b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "アドマイヤベガはついに、\r\n本気でライバルとの戦いに胸を躍らせて、\n『日本ダービー』のコースに立つ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f6ec7657bb3dc587a7f407a15e6b064c655e919a89f6c982c557d0a4ea72e1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1033/storytimeline_501033411.json",
      "json_path": [
